The QR Verification Workflow:

    When an assessment is approved, the system generates a Signed QR Code.

    A customs exit gate officer or bank cashier scans the QR code with their mobile device.

    The scanner immediately opens a verified verification page showing:

        Status: PAID & CLEARED (Green) or UNDER REVIEW (Yellow) or FRAUD/INVALID (Red).

        Declarant Name & TIN.

        Total Tax Paid.